<title>CANADA: Heavy rain warning issued for southeast Alberta-EC.</title>
<headline>Heavy rain warning issued for southeast Alberta-EC.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A heavy rainfall warning was issued Wednesday for southeast Alberta's Lethbridge district, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Lethbridge should see up to 60 mm (2.4 inches) of rain into Wednesday night, meteorologist Francois Choquette said.</p>
<p>Calgary should see up to 50 mm (2 inches) and Medicine Hat should see 20 mm (0.8 inch) of rain, Choquette added.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
